"Later, Sarah joins Nathan Lark as one of the Heirs and swears their oath on the Gemore Seal."
"Later, Nathan teaches Gemore's crafters firearms, and her first rifle comes from Beatred's smithy."
"She becomes a [Sniper] with rifle and revolvers, firing enchanted and penetrator rounds."
"Years later the Questor Garna teaches her ranged theory in Keihona."
"In Esebus she takes an endless ammunition pouch and Sussu's ring of [Quenfi's Hatred]."
"She keeps Sussu's body in a dimensional bag."
"From across the city of Esebus she shoots Badud through the head while he hides in a market."
"At level 729 she takes the Edge of the Horizon class; distance cannot blur her sight."
"She wears boots that teleport her to any spot in sight at a click of the heels."
"She shoots a Sangrad warship's captain and mage from a hundred miles or more away."
"An Insight of intent turns a shapeshifting bow from Sussu's vault into a chiming rifle."
"Over the Blight she shoots down every obelisk crystal and kills a Grave Tangle alone."
"In the Ostren war she kills Aleph snipers and shoots Evesor in the throat."
"At the Conclave she kills a Questor trying to snap a rod of annihilation, and keeps a rod."
"Nine years later she escorts rangers clearing dungeons in the mountains north of Gemore."
"She can then teleport from those mountains back to Gemore."
